      <title>美团把GPT-5.5、Claude Opus 4.8免费使用</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2444817</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2444817</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 17:26:11 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;tabbit是美团近期上线的AI应用，分国际版和国内版双轨。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;国际版&lt;/strong&gt;：免费接入GPT-5.5、Claude Opus 4.8、Gemini 3.5 Flash，外加Kimi-2.6、GLM-5.1、MiniMax-M3。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;国内版&lt;/strong&gt;：仅提供国内模型（Kimi、GLM、MiniMax等），无海外旗舰。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/f/7/0f7966f394e271a8d9e4140a31cca10a9097bc2e.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/2cTgqyoZIf8f4bFQyh6fNi0Xs8C.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/f/7/0f7966f394e271a8d9e4140a31cca10a9097bc2e.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;2cTgqyoZIf8f4bFQyh6fNi0Xs8C&quot; width=&quot;671&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;EDEDEE&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/6/d/0/6d050d23943f2af2b1ba990202f1d16081551ef6.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/fyqRJyJBHHJ0zqItaJZZGU4l2GG.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/6/d/0/6d050d23943f2af2b1ba990202f1d16081551ef6_2_690x389.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;fyqRJyJBHHJ0zqItaJZZGU4l2GG&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;389&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/6/d/0/6d050d23943f2af2b1ba990202f1d16081551ef6_2_690x389.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/6/d/0/6d050d23943f2af2b1ba990202f1d16081551ef6_2_1035x583.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/6/d/0/6d050d23943f2af2b1ba990202f1d16081551ef6_2_1380x778.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;2E2D2C&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
