    <item>
      <title>（新人向 · 持续更新）最近总结的免费用 GLM 5.2 / DeepSeekV4 的几个方法</title>
      <link>https://linux.do/t/topic/2441446</link>
      <guid>linux.do-topic-2441446</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 04:28:39 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;如果你跟我一样抢不到智谱 CodingPlan 又想用 GLM 5.2，或者是额度跑完想用其他 Token 续命的，可以试试下面几个方法（无广告，纯经验）：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;如果没使用过&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.codebuddy.cn/home/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;CodeBuddy&lt;/a&gt;/WorkBuddy，新人会免费送额度，可以用 DSV4pro 跟 GLM5.2。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/e/4/3e4135ca661607de846e55859bb48eae34285091.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/8SJjxE7ssIrzXLUumwrLBRd5SNj.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/e/4/3e4135ca661607de846e55859bb48eae34285091_2_690x374.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;8SJjxE7ssIrzXLUumwrLBRd5SNj&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;374&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/3/e/4/3e4135ca661607de846e55859bb48eae34285091_2_690x374.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/e/4/3e4135ca661607de846e55859bb48eae34285091.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/3/e/4/3e4135ca661607de846e55859bb48eae34285091.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;2C2B3E&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/2/0/f/20fd889d324dc7036baaf5608b7a82b1f1385b45.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/4HQthS5G4OPM5n9ZICI9ipQQ4zX.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/0/f/20fd889d324dc7036baaf5608b7a82b1f1385b45_2_690x412.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;4HQthS5G4OPM5n9ZICI9ipQQ4zX&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;412&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/2/0/f/20fd889d324dc7036baaf5608b7a82b1f1385b45_2_690x412.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/2/0/f/20fd889d324dc7036baaf5608b7a82b1f1385b45.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/2/0/f/20fd889d324dc7036baaf5608b7a82b1f1385b45.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;21222F&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hyper.charm.land/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Hyper Charm &lt;/a&gt;每月 100 &lt;strong&gt;Hypercredits。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/0/2/5/02549a4efb5c31ea7a47e6db814719d977933213.jpeg&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/kCdmvWzLYGfwN2lURS9jcKVTCH.jpeg?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/2/5/02549a4efb5c31ea7a47e6db814719d977933213_2_690x328.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;kCdmvWzLYGfwN2lURS9jcKVTCH&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;328&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/2/5/02549a4efb5c31ea7a47e6db814719d977933213_2_690x328.jpeg, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/2/5/02549a4efb5c31ea7a47e6db814719d977933213_2_1035x492.jpeg 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/0/2/5/02549a4efb5c31ea7a47e6db814719d977933213_2_1380x656.jpeg 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;6C4CEA&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;智谱的 &lt;a href=&quot;https://zcode.z.ai/cn&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;ZCode&lt;/a&gt;， 新人送5天，每天 3百万 Token 的 GLM5.2。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://qoder.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Qoder&lt;/a&gt; 为期 2 周的 Pro 试用及 300 Credits。缺点上下文 200K。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/a/f/faf681f2d95580fc938828f8f16c1e0846dee41d.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/zO7vtJqOM8Foi317BVn6hw3mR2d.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/a/f/faf681f2d95580fc938828f8f16c1e0846dee41d_2_690x324.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;zO7vtJqOM8Foi317BVn6hw3mR2d&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;324&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/f/a/f/faf681f2d95580fc938828f8f16c1e0846dee41d_2_690x324.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/a/f/faf681f2d95580fc938828f8f16c1e0846dee41d.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/f/a/f/faf681f2d95580fc938828f8f16c1e0846dee41d.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;252523&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://bailian.console.aliyun.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;阿里云百炼&lt;/a&gt; 新人送 100+国模，每个 100K Token，建议聚合一下，用来跑小任务还是不错的。记得全部开启【&lt;strong&gt;免费额度用完即停&lt;/strong&gt;】，不然超出额度会扣账号余额。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/e/4/6/e46c90a18893c8931dc112672608000a24e9120e.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/wAJsGkUcEcT4F7DJ3wLR1S12vzo.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/6/e46c90a18893c8931dc112672608000a24e9120e_2_690x322.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;wAJsGkUcEcT4F7DJ3wLR1S12vzo&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;322&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/6/e46c90a18893c8931dc112672608000a24e9120e_2_690x322.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/6/e46c90a18893c8931dc112672608000a24e9120e_2_1035x483.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/e/4/6/e46c90a18893c8931dc112672608000a24e9120e_2_1380x644.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;F5F5FA&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sensenova.cn/token-plan&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;商汤日日新&lt;/a&gt; DeepSeek V4 Flash免费用，包括旗下两个自研模型。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/a/d/8/ad87dabc79dc70ddddee3d9102ea19ca0065634c.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/oL7FukeHWWrzNmtJQxLTkTwrDg8.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/d/8/ad87dabc79dc70ddddee3d9102ea19ca0065634c_2_690x222.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;oL7FukeHWWrzNmtJQxLTkTwrDg8&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;222&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/d/8/ad87dabc79dc70ddddee3d9102ea19ca0065634c_2_690x222.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/d/8/ad87dabc79dc70ddddee3d9102ea19ca0065634c_2_1035x333.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/a/d/8/ad87dabc79dc70ddddee3d9102ea19ca0065634c_2_1380x444.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;EEEFF7&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.openmodel.ai/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;OpenModel&lt;/a&gt; DeepSeek V4 Flash免费用：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;lightbox-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;lightbox&quot; href=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/original/4X/d/2/f/d2fcd2c94006a210fd7fcadb4d7ed7af536513d1.png&quot; data-download-href=&quot;/uploads/short-url/u6tWiSrrB9seis93wsnkFf3sLmh.png?dl=1&quot; title=&quot;image&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/f/d2fcd2c94006a210fd7fcadb4d7ed7af536513d1_2_591x500.png&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot; data-base62-sha1=&quot;u6tWiSrrB9seis93wsnkFf3sLmh&quot; width=&quot;591&quot; height=&quot;500&quot; srcset=&quot;https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/f/d2fcd2c94006a210fd7fcadb4d7ed7af536513d1_2_591x500.png, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/f/d2fcd2c94006a210fd7fcadb4d7ed7af536513d1_2_886x750.png 1.5x, https://cdn3.ldstatic.com/optimized/4X/d/2/f/d2fcd2c94006a210fd7fcadb4d7ed7af536513d1_2_1182x1000.png 2x&quot; data-dominant-color=&quot;202020&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenCode Zen 也能免费用 DeepSeek V4 Flash：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;aside class=&quot;quote no-group&quot; data-username=&quot;ageovb&quot; data-display-name=&quot;72&quot; data-post=&quot;5&quot; data-topic=&quot;2441748&quot; data-full=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;quote-controls&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;img alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;24&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; src=&quot;https://cdn.ldstatic.com/user_avatar/linux.do/ageovb/48/2078075_2.png&quot; class=&quot;avatar&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2441748/5&quot;&gt;OpenCode的免费模型咋来的？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;用你的数据去训练了呀&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;另外，除了在 OpenCode 用，还可以在第三方使用&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;URL：&lt;a href=&quot;https://opencode.ai/zen/v1&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;https://opencode.ai/zen/v1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;key：public&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;超限了，换个 IP 即可&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/aside&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;其他免费的第三方 API：&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://agnes-ai.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;Agnes&lt;/a&gt; 自研模型，长期免费。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.stepfun.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener nofollow ugc&quot;&gt;阶跃星辰 &lt;/a&gt;自研模型，新人免费 15 天。&lt;/p&gt;
